    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/ae73494d3ef712a5bf815226519ccb9e.poster.avif?t=1747939427\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/ae73494d3ef712a5bf815226519ccb9e.webm?t=1747939427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/ae73494d3ef712a5bf815226519ccb9e.mp4?t=1747939427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    Build \u00a0 a passionate hate for time wasting puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Its very Casual Fun for everyone to Enjoy and Relax!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Play Levels inspired by classic video game mechanics, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only to realize the futility of your attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reward? Cheerful situational humor,   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUELY IMAGINATIVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gameplay of <i>Brainrot </i>Parade 3 is wholly original, comprised of lavishly decorated Levels that players interact\u00a0 \u00a0 in imaginative ways to solve puzzles. Impeccably simple, yet satisfyingly complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GORGEOUSLY GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/58ed921f0ae4ae3f72c65d154d67c3a4.poster.avif?t=1747939427\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/58ed921f0ae4ae3f72c65d154d67c3a4.webm?t=1747939427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/58ed921f0ae4ae3f72c65d154d67c3a4.mp4?t=1747939427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A NEW KIND OF STORYTELLING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BrainRot Parade 3</i> isn't just a game - it's a work of art, expressing itself through soulful, charming Style and distinguished puzzle mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/da5e28ec47a8dd6edcd3a9c9d0f8792f.poster.avif?t=1747939427\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/da5e28ec47a8dd6edcd3a9c9d0f8792f.webm?t=1747939427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/da5e28ec47a8dd6edcd3a9c9d0f8792f.mp4?t=1747939427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Deception&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Typically means something appears or seems one way, but is actually different or the opposite. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Deceit&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implies a more intentional act of misleading or betraying trust. It suggests a deliberate attempt to deceive or trick someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Brainrot</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refers to a state of thinking or reasoning that appears flawed, irrational, or unsound, but in a way that is insidious or difficult to detect. It describes a mental state that may seem coherent or logical on the surface, but is actually compromised by faulty logic or inherent biases.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/ae73494d3ef712a5bf815226519ccb9e.poster.avif?t=1747939427\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/ae73494d3ef712a5bf815226519ccb9e.webm?t=1747939427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/ae73494d3ef712a5bf815226519ccb9e.mp4?t=1747939427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>    Build \u00a0 a passionate hate for time wasting puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Its very Casual Fun for everyone to Enjoy and Relax!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Play Levels inspired by classic video game mechanics, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only to realize the futility of your attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reward? Cheerful situational humor,   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUELY IMAGINATIVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gameplay of <i>Brainrot </i>Parade 3 is wholly original, comprised of lavishly decorated Levels that players interact\u00a0 \u00a0 in imaginative ways to solve puzzles. Impeccably simple, yet satisfyingly complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GORGEOUSLY GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/58ed921f0ae4ae3f72c65d154d67c3a4.poster.avif?t=1747939427\" width=600 h